    "title": "Ward 3 reps to hold July Council and Coffee open house this Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "10 hours ago CHEYENNE – Cheyenne’s City Council Ward 3 representatives will hold a Council and Coffee open house on Saturday, July 18, from 9-11 a.m. at Dazbog Coffee, 3911 E. Pershing Blvd., Suite A.\nDiscussion will include items related to Ward 3 and other city projects, with the opportunity for residents to voice concerns and get to know their representatives.\nThe next Ward 3 City Council and Coffee will be held in August.",
